                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="vuma-content-card">

                <div class="vuma-content-header">
                    <div class="vuma-eyebrow">Step 1 of 7</div>
                    <h2>Welcome to Vuma Retail</h2>

                    <p>
                        This installation hasn't been configured yet.
                        We'll guide you through the setup and create the business
                        structure required for this installation.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="vuma-content-body">

                    <div class="vuma-info-grid">

                        <div class="vuma-info-box">
                            <div class="vuma-info-icon">01</div>
                            <strong>Business structure</strong>
                            <span>
                                Add your legal companies and define how many
                                locations each company operates from.
                            </span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="vuma-info-box">
                            <div class="vuma-info-icon">02</div>
                            <strong>Modules</strong>
                            <span>
                                Select the Vuma modules included in this
                                installation's licence.
                            </span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="vuma-info-box">
                            <div class="vuma-info-icon">03</div>
                            <strong>Licence limits</strong>
